{"id":"ad7597f76fe86d61","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/505_Markov_原理系统_MP.md","title":"505 Markov 原理系统 MP","display":"505_Markov_原理系统_MP","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{505}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{505}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span>。公式构造子为等词、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to\\bot\">\\(A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与可判定片段\">2. 项、公式与可判定片段</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t+u,t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(t+u,t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA,\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\forall xA,\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>可判定片段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小子集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(A\\land B,A\\lor B,A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(St)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(St)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{505}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{505}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{505}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{505}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(t=u)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(t=u)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{505}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{505}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\">\\(\\operatorname{Subt}_{505}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\)</span> 由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0[x:=t]=0,\n\\qquad\n(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0[x:=t]=0,\n\\qquad\n(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\qquad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\qquad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{505}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{505}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span> 的非量词子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>量词处使用</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(X)=v_m,\\quad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(X)=v_m,\\quad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>进行冲突改名。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=Qz((B[y:=z])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=Qz((B[y:=z])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{505}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{505}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{505}\\)</span> 为所有关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span> 的集合，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系，并满足下列封闭条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((B,B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\">\\((QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{505}(\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxB,Qz(B[x:=z]))\\in E\">\\((QxB,Qz(B[x:=z]))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,505}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{505}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,505}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{505}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>直觉主义命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{505}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A)\\}\n\\cup\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{505}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A)\\}\n\\cup\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 全部取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>量词公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{505}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{505}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词与自然数公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{505}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{505}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{505}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{505}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{505}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可判定性公理族与 Markov 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\n=\n\\{A\\lor(A\\to\\bot):A\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\n=\n\\{A\\lor(A\\to\\bot):A\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}\n=\n\\{(((\\exists xA)\\to\\bot)\\to\\bot)\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}\n=\n\\{(((\\exists xA)\\to\\bot)\\to\\bot)\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505},A\\in\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{505}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{505}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则、证明与可证性\">5. 规则、证明与可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{505}\\)</span>，定义带支持的证明行与候选证明载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Line}_{505}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\n=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N,\\,m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{505}(\\Gamma)^m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Line}_{505}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\n=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N,\\,m&gt;0}\\mathsf{Line}_{505}(\\Gamma)^m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|=m\">\\(|\\pi|=m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)=(\\Delta_i,A_i)\">\\(\\pi(i)=(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{505}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{505}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\n(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505}\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\;\n(A_i=\\forall x\\,A_j\n\\land ((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(G)\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j&lt;i\\;\n(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,505}A_i\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{505}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{505}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j,k&lt;i\\;\n(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505}\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{505}\\;\n(A_i=\\forall x\\,A_j\n\\land ((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{505}(G)\n\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\bigl(\\exists j&lt;i\\;\n(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,505}A_i\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每行至少满足上述五个许可之一。推广行中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与其结论的绑定变量是同一个变量。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma):\n\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\operatorname{LineOK}_{505}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{\\pi\\in\\mathsf{CandProof}_{505}(\\Gamma):\n\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\operatorname{LineOK}_{505}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{505}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{505}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{505}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{505}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{505}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{505}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{505}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-目标区分\">6. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Dec}_{505}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Dec}^{505}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{MP}^{505}\\)</span>。它不加入 Church 论题的递归图原子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个句法形式系统\">7. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{MP}_{505}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\mathsf{Dec}_{505},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505},\\operatorname{FV}_{505},\\operatorname{BV}_{505},\\operatorname{Subt}_{505},\\operatorname{Sub}_{505},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,505},\\mathsf{Ax}_{505},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{505},\\vdash_{505}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{MP}_{505}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{505},\\mathsf{Tm}_{505},\\mathsf{Frm}_{505},\\mathsf{Dec}_{505},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{505},\\operatorname{FV}_{505},\\operatorname{BV}_{505},\\operatorname{Subt}_{505},\\operatorname{Sub}_{505},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,505},\\mathsf{Ax}_{505},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{505},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{505},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{505},\\vdash_{505}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含算术句法、可判定片段、Marko